[5063]="7003466A\n1\tEncuentra la granja de Thrymm cerca de Forlaw\tLa granja de Thrymm se encuentra al sureste de Forlaw. El camino fuera de la puerta este se bifurca, y el sendero sur atraviesa directamente esta granja.\n2\tHay algunos sobrevivientes pidiendo ayuda alrededor de la granja de Thrymm. Estas llamadas parecen provenir de los bordes exteriores de la granja.\t\n3\tEncuentra a Oter en el centro de la granja de Thrymm\tLos agricultores rescatados corrieron hacia el granero en el centro de la granja. Encuentra y habla con Oter, que parece ser el más experimentado entre estos agricultores.\n",
[5064]="7006C12E\n1\tRecupera los cascos robados (total: 8)\030Derrota a los crebain (total: 12)\tRecupera los tocados en Ghât Okho y derrota a los crebain.\n",
[5065]="70066CC1\n1\tFind a spare waggon wheel in Lond Cirion\tNatholan has asked you to find a spare wheel in Lond Cirion. Lond Cirion can be found to the west.\n2\tTalk to Natholan at Echad Lendir\tYou have found a suitable spare wheel for Natholan's waggon. Return it to Natholan just outside of Echad Lendir. Echad Lendir can be found to the east along the road to Barad Faen.\n",
[5066]="700379C6\n1\tSpeak with Grimwald to begin the race\tGrimwald is outside of Grimslade's Mead Hall. You should speak with Grimwald.\n2\tMake it to the front gate before Grimwald\tThe end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade. You should race Grimwald to the front gate.\n3\tRace Grimwald to the stable in the north-west of town\tThe end of your race with Grimwald is at the stable in the south-west of town. You should race Grimwald to the stable.\n4\tRace Grimwald to the Mead Hall\tThe end of your race with Grimwald is at the Mead Hall in Grimslade. You should race Grimwald to the Mead Hall.\n5\tRace Grimwald to the front gate\tThe end of your race with Grimwald is at the front gate of Grimslade. You should race Grimwald to the front gate.\n6\tSpeak with Grimwald at the Mead Hall\tGrimwald is outside the Mead Hall of Grimslade. You should speak with Grimwald.\n",
